---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Work | Jacob Chesslo"
  description="Work experience of Jacob Chesslo - software engineer at Blue Origin and scientist at ENSCO."
>
  <main class="work-main">
    <div class="work-header">
      <h1 class="work-title">Work Experience</h1>
      <div class="work-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="work-intro">The projects I've worked on throughout my career.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="work-list">
      <div id="work-blue" class="retro-card work-card">
        <div class="work-card-inner">
          <div class="work-dot work-dot--primary" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="work-content">
            <h2 class="work-company">Blue Origin</h2>
            <p class="work-meta">
              Software Engineer I &rarr; II &rarr; III &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Oct 2022 &ndash; Present
            </p>
            <p class="work-body">
              Engineering Productivity / Engineering Platforms - Advanced Concepts &amp; Enterprise
              Engineering. Led technical development of the K9 avionics execution platform, serving
              as the backbone for the highest-stakes verification efforts on New Glenn (NG-1).
              Designed and shipped a task-caching mechanism that saved over 386 days of compute time
              in its first three months. Architected a k9core shared library with 40+ releases in
              2024, and drove company-wide standards for CI/CD, Terraform, and Ansible. Acted as
              primary point of contact for Lunar, New Glenn, and Engines verification teams;
              recognized multiple times for exemplary customer focus. Active in five Business
              Resource Groups and a Bar Raiser interviewer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="work-ensco" class="retro-card work-card">
        <div class="work-card-inner">
          <div class="work-dot work-dot--secondary" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="work-content">
            <h2 class="work-company work-company--secondary">ENSCO, Inc.</h2>
            <p class="work-meta">Scientist II &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Mar 2021 &ndash; Oct 2022</p>
            <p class="work-body">
              Mission Systems Group. Designed, developed, and maintained parallel HPC scientific
              software in C, C++, Fortran, and Python (MPI, CMake). Created Fermantic, an IR
              spectroscopy analysis package that reduced a key bottleneck algorithm's runtime by
              over five orders of magnitude (hours &rarr; milliseconds). Contributed to ACES4, a
              parallel ab initio quantum chemistry package, building PyACES, PyACESTests, and
              PyCluster tooling. Migrated legacy DoD seismic software from MATLAB to Python/MySQL;
              established code-review culture and mentored an intern to a full-time role.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hallmark · macrostructure: Long Document · tone: atmospheric · anchor hue: violet */

  .work-main {
    padding: 3rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .work-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .work-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .work-rule {
    width: 6rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-bright), var(--secondary));
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .work-intro {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .work-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .work-card-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .work-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .work-dot--primary {
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .work-dot--secondary {
    background: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .work-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .work-company {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .work-company--secondary {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .work-meta {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .work-body {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
